# The repo is kept fully self-contained: trained checkpoints (best.keras),
# plots, metrics and comparison/website artifacts are all committed so a clone
# can run inference and view every result without retraining.
# Only the resumable-session state is skipped - it duplicates the weights and
# is useful only inside a live training run (e.g. a dropped Colab session).
